---
// Hero section component
---

<section class="hero" aria-label="Úvodní sekce">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="hero-label">Studentská iniciativa za veřejnoprávní média · StRada FF UK</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">MEDIA&nbsp;</br><span class="highlight">NEDAME!</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Vyzýváme veškeré studenstvo k protestnímu walkoutu na obranu veřejnoprávních médií.
        Přidejte se! Je za minutu dvanáct!
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://www.facebook.com/events/s/media-nedame/1349185803730756/?rdid=0GoJbEjAxOx7B6jj&share_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fshare%2F1DM14J5jVX#"
        class="hero-event-banner"
        aria-label="Informace o akci – otevřít Facebook událost"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        <div class="event-detail">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days event-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span>středa <strong>22. dubna</strong> v <strong>11:59</strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="event-detail">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot event-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span>náměstí Jana Palacha</span>
        </div>
        <div class="event-detail">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-person-walking event-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span>odchod z výuky · pochod k ministerstvu kultury</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#co-delame" class="btn btn-primary">Jak se zapojit</a>
        <a href="/tiskova-zprava.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-doc" download aria-label="Stáhnout tisková zpráva jako PDF">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          Tisková zpráva
        </a>
        <a href="/Prohlášení Média nedáme!.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-doc" download aria-label="Stáhnout prohlášení jako PDF">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          Prohlášení
        </a>
        <a href="/mapa+harmonogram.pdf" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-doc" download aria-label="Stáhnout mapu a program jako PDF">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          Mapa + program
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-spread">
        Budeme rádi za šíření. Dejte si to vědět mezi sebou, ve škole, proberte to s pedagogy nebo ve školních radách.
        Jedná se o studentskou iniciativu, ale může se k ní přidat každý, kdo cítí závažnost této situace.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 92vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 6rem 5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f0f 0%, #1a0a1a 50%, #0a1a0a 100%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero-bg::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(255, 0, 204, 0.2) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(127, 255, 0, 0.15) 0%, transparent 45%);
  }

  .hero .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .hero-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-primary);
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Black Han Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 10vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    padding-right: 0.05em;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    max-width: 58ch;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .hero-event-banner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem 2rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .hero-event-banner:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
  }

  .event-detail {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  }

  .event-detail strong {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .event-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    width: 1.25em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .btn-doc {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .btn-doc svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hero-spread {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    max-width: 60ch;
    line-height: 1.6;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding-block: 5rem 4rem;
    }

    .hero-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .hero-event-banner {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .hero-actions .btn {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    .hero {
      padding-block: 4.5rem 3rem;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 11vw, 2.5rem);
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }
</style>
